*)

(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: the epoxy has not set after the
   1 + 3 ticks heating and extruding bank, since it needs five:

     Typing error: Comparing resource inequality
       ({Heat; Extrude},{Heat; Extrude})
       <= ({5},{7}) failed
*)
